    <string name="licences_body">Saga is free software under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later.\n\nSource code: https://github.com/Supermagnum/saga\nAGPL source offer: the complete corresponding source for the version you are running is available at that repository (and via F-Droid when published). Contact the project if you need a source tarball for a specific build.\n\nThird-party components\n======================\n\nCall-state icons (icons/)\n  Licence: AGPL — see icons/readme.md in the source tree.\n\nGaldralag-firmware crates (ephemeral-session, galdr-core, galdr-vault, and companions)\n  Source: https://github.com/Supermagnum/Galdralag-firmware\n  Licence: GPL-3.0\n\niroh and related n0 crates\n  Licence: MIT OR Apache-2.0\n\niroh-roq (RTP over QUIC; Saga fork)\n  Upstream: https://github.com/n0-computer/iroh-roq\n  Fork: https://github.com/Supermagnum/iroh-roq\n  Licence: MIT OR Apache-2.0\n\nwebrtc-srtp (SRTP AEAD_AES_256_GCM)\n  Licence: MIT OR Apache-2.0\n\nopus / libopus\n  Licence: BSD-3-Clause\n\nRustCrypto crates (sha2, hmac, hkdf, aes-gcm, ecdsa, bp256/bp384, zeroize, \u2026)\n  Licence: typically MIT OR Apache-2.0\n\nopenpgp-card / card-backend (Nitrokey OpenPGP client)\n  Licence: MIT OR Apache-2.0\n\nAndroid / Jetpack libraries\n  Licence: Apache-2.0\n\nSee NOTICE in the source tree for pin revisions and full notes.</string>
